      "canonicalJson": "{\"applicability\":null,\"conditions\":[\"油面过低时\",\"适用对象: 通用（书未限定具体车型或变速器型号）\"],\"counterexamples\":[],\"evidence_ids\":[\"book:1jDTXgUQ5NSX-YyBkMFuKnrwmhec4F84E:ev:p10:e5\"],\"id\":\"claim:1jDTXgUQ5NSX-YyBkMFuKnrwmhec4F84E:c01q0105:0052\",\"predicate\":\"corrective_action\",\"qualification_status\":\"EXTRACTED_UNCHECKED\",\"source_kind\":\"BOOK_BODY_DIRECT\",\"statement\":\"油面过低先补油到标准，再运转检查泄漏点，漏油立即修复。\",\"subject_id\":\"book:1jDTXgUQ5NSX-YyBkMFuKnrwmhec4F84E:ent:k16\",\"unknowns\":[],\"value\":\"油面过低应继续向油管中加入自动变速器油直至油面高度符合标准；继续运转发动机检查油底壳、油管接头等处有无漏油，如有漏油应立即予以修复。\"}",
